{"dependency_pins":[{"alias":"core","revision_id":"944f9f3706254af3330d7ffe95359534178972d94b4893dba0901c1969588ac0"},{"alias":"shipping","revision_id":"ec81dc20684f84369e51403b7ac1ec2586e9a950fbf6a9eabd8844ec1eccfddf"}],"documents":[{"document":{"concepts":[{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.baseline","role":"entity"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.baseline","property":"event_id","role":"identifier"}],"description":"An original baseline shipping-process observation, including the Northwind example orders and synthetic control scenarios. These records do not import future recovery examples.","id":"baseline-observation","kind":"entity","labels":{"en":"Baseline shipping observation"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGateway","role":"entity"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGateway","property":"event_id","role":"identifier"}],"description":"An original baseline simulated booking request or response for healthy order 11038 only. It is not a real carrier API call or evidence that blocked orders 11045 or 11062 were booked.","id":"carrier-gateway-entry","kind":"entity","labels":{"en":"Baseline carrier-gateway entry"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11045example","role":"entity"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11045example","property":"event_id","role":"identifier"}],"description":"A separately stored shipping-process entry illustrating a possible future replay for order 11045. It is not baseline observation or executed recovery evidence.","id":"order11045-recovery-example","kind":"entity","labels":{"en":"Order 11045 recovery example"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11062example","role":"entity"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11062example","property":"event_id","role":"identifier"}],"description":"A separately stored shipping-process entry illustrating a possible future replay for order 11062, whose replay is pending. It does not establish that the replay happened.","id":"order11062-recovery-example","kind":"entity","labels":{"en":"Order 11062 recovery example"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11045example","role":"entity"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11045example","property":"event_id","role":"identifier"}],"description":"A simulated carrier-gateway entry illustrating a possible future order 11045 replay. It is not an original baseline observation, a real carrier call or proof of physical shipping.","id":"carrier-order11045-recovery-example","kind":"entity","labels":{"en":"Order 11045 carrier example"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11062example","role":"entity"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11062example","property":"event_id","role":"identifier"}],"description":"A simulated carrier-gateway entry illustrating a possible future order 11062 replay. It does not establish an executed replay, real booking or physical shipping.","id":"carrier-order11062-recovery-example","kind":"entity","labels":{"en":"Order 11062 carrier example"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.baseline","property":"attempt_id","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGateway","property":"attempt_id","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11045example","property":"attempt_id","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11062example","property":"attempt_id","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11045example","property":"attempt_id","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11062example","property":"attempt_id","role":"value"}],"description":"An attempt identifier referring to the Shipping attempt concept. Baseline IDs can correspond to recorded attempts; future example IDs need not exist in the Shipping baseline. This semantic reference creates no