/core/order?ref=982916d73f0a35ff2558b0062f58aa3ac4f24d97"},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.baseline","property":"kind","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGateway","property":"kind","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11045example","property":"kind","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11062example","property":"kind","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11045example","property":"kind","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11062example","property":"kind","role":"value"}],"description":"The kind of synthetic observation, such as request-created, replay-started or booking-confirmed. A kind found in a recovery-example collection remains illustrative.","id":"event-kind","kind":"attribute","labels":{"en":"Event kind"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.baseline","property":"occurred_at","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGateway","property":"occurred_at","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11045example","property":"occurred_at","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11062example","property":"occurred_at","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11045example","property":"occurred_at","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11062example","property":"occurred_at","role":"value"}],"description":"The timestamp recorded for the synthetic observation, qualified by clock_domain and precision_ms. A future example timestamp does not establish that an action occurred.","id":"event-time","kind":"attribute","labels":{"en":"Event time"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.baseline","property":"clock_domain","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGateway","property":"clock_domain","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11045example","property":"clock_domain","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11062example","property":"clock_domain","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11045example","property":"clock_domain","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11062example","property":"clock_domain","role":"value"}],"description":"The clock whose timestamps the record uses. Clock domains must be considered before comparing event times across streams.","id":"clock-domain","kind":"attribute","labels":{"en":"Clock domain"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.baseline","property":"sequence","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGateway","property":"sequence","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11045example","property":"sequence","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11062example","property":"sequence","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11045example","property":"sequence","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.recovery11062example","property":"sequence","role":"value"}],"description":"The recorded event order within a stream and attempt. Sequence numbers are not a global order across collections or a substitute for clock-domain-aware time comparisons.","id":"event-sequence","kind":"attribute","labels":{"en":"Event sequence"}},{"bindings":[{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGateway","property":"correlation_id","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11045example","property":"correlation_id","role":"value"},{"model":"modelspec:///shipping_logs.carrierGatewayRecovery11062example","property":"correlation_id","role":"value"}],"description":"The scenario identifier relating a gateway exchange to its Shipping request. It correlates records without proving successful processing.","id":"correlation-id","kind":"